{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2bb81c79",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "28b03822",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 图 1.5"
   ]
  },
  {
   "attachments": {
    "1.5.png": {
     "image/png": ""
    }
   },
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "caa1f741",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "![1.5.png](attachment:1.5.png)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7c3621cc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d30b7346",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 背景信息"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "37a645bc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "假设开展单因子两水平试验,因子水平取 $x=0$ 和 $x=1$,各设置 3 次重复试验,试验数据如图 1.5 中蓝色实心圆点所示.$h(\\cdot)$ 为图中黑色实线对应的真实函数,试验者事先未知该函数形式.线性回归模型广泛应用于物理试验研究.采用模型 $y_{i}=\\beta_{0}+\\beta_{1}x_{i}+\\varepsilon_{i}$ 拟合试验数据,其中 $i=1,\\dots,n$(本例样本量 $n=6$),误差项满足 $\\varepsilon_{i}\\stackrel{\\text{i.i.d.}}{\\sim}\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^{2})$.图左侧子图展示了线性模型拟合直线及其 95% 置信区间.Gauss 过程回归在该类试验场景中应用较少,其拟合结果见同图右侧子图."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "084b56e5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b9b15657",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 指令"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "211db403",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "创建宽 10 英寸,高 5 英寸的画布:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "901c2169",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "options(repr.plot.width=10,repr.plot.height=5)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a4f54302",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "将画布分为 1x2:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f0ef6ca7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "par(mfrow=c(1,2))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d24893a3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "创建向量 $\\boldsymbol{x}=(0,0,0,1,1,1)$:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1b34e81d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "n=6\n",
    "x=rep(c(0,1),c(n/2,n/2))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5259e673",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "定义"未知"(做试验时是未知的,此处为了展示两种拟合的精度比较便设为已知)的真实响应曲面函数"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dbf8938f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "f(\\boldsymbol{x}):=\\frac{\\sin(10\\pi\\boldsymbol{x})}{1+64(\\boldsymbol{x}-1/4)^{2}}+\\boldsymbol{x}^{2}:\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1558d14a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "f=function(x) sin(10*pi*x)/(1+64*(x-.25)^2)+x^2\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "99f383d7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "添加随机噪声"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "88cff92c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "y:=f(\\boldsymbol{x})+\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon}/10,\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e1bfe298",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "其中 $\\boldsymbol{\\varepsilon}=(\\varepsilon_{1},\\dots,\\varepsilon_{n})\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,0.1^{2})$:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2b5a1949",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "set.seed(7)\n",
    "y=f(x)+.1*rnorm(n)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ba4fb451",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "为了定义绘图的左右边界,生成从 $-0.25$ 到 $1.25$,间隔 $0.001$ 的等距序列:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fe639954",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "l=-.25\n",
    "u=1.25\n",
    "test=seq(l,u,.001)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "94c40683",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "计算真实函数的值:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3f061443",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "truey=f(test)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7a7eba66",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "线性拟合散点 `y~x`:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c03b33e5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "a.lm=lm(y~x)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "bc294bab",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "计算预测区间,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- $x$ 的范围为从 $-0.25$ 到 $1.25$,间隔 $0.001$ 的等距序列;\n",
    "- 同时计算所有点的预测区间:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "147df1cd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "pred=predict.lm(a.lm,newdata=data.frame(x=test),interval=\"prediction\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5b0b6e00",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "由于不能直接创建绘制多边形的画布,因此先创建一个空白画布,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 折线类型为空;\n",
    "- $x$ 轴范围为 $[-0.25,1.25]$,$y$ 轴范围为 $[\\min(y)-0.5,1.5]$;\n",
    "- 图形主标题为"Linear regression";\n",
    "- 主标题缩放倍数为 2:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f3615bcd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "plot(test,truey,type=\"n\",xlim=c(l,u),ylim=c(min(y)-.5,1.5),main=\"Linear regression\",cex.main=2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "99bebe23",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "令 95% 预测区间(自动计算)的上下界分别为 `up` 与 `low`.叠加置信区间多边形,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 多边形边界为 $[-0.25,1.25]\\times[\\text{low},\\text{up}]$;\n",
    "- 多边形颜色为粉色;\n",
    "- 边界颜色为粉色:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ba356803",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "low=pred[,2]\n",
    "up=pred[,3]\n",
    "polygon(c(test,rev(test)),c(low,rev(up)),col=\"pink\",border=\"pink\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8d1122ee",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "叠加拟合值 $\\widehat{y}$,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 线的颜色为绿色;\n",
    "- 线的宽度为 3;\n",
    "- 线的类型为虚线:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d0685dbc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "lines(test,pred[,1],col=3,lwd=3,lty=2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a4fec033",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "叠加真实值 $f(\\boldsymbol{x})$,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 线的宽度为 3:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0f0021e1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "lines(test,truey,lwd=3)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2a467234",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "叠加散点,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 点的形状为实心圆;\n",
    "- 点的缩放倍数为 2;\n",
    "- 点的颜色为蓝色:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3ae9a1e7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "points(x,y,pch=16,cex=2,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "83d61e7b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "叠加图例,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 位置位于左上角;\n",
    "- 给真实曲线和预测值添加标签;\n",
    "- 线型,颜色,线宽与二者分别对应;\n",
    "- 不画图例边框:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fd4c1773",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "legend(\"topleft\", legend = c(\"truth\",\"prediction\"),lty=c(1,2),col=c(1,3),lwd=c(3,3),bty = \"n\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "13bb4fce",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "使用 `rkriging` 包中的 `Fit.kriging` 函数 GP 拟合散点 `y~x`,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 数据有噪声;\n",
    "- 自动学习最优平滑参数;\n",
    "- 均值未知;\n",
    "- 使用 Gauss 核:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2a3befae",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "library(rkriging)\n",
    "a.gp=Fit.Kriging(x,y,interpolation=FALSE,fit=TRUE,model=\"OK\",kernel.parameters=list(type=\"Gaussian\"))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d9d37d6d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "计算预测区间,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- $x$ 的范围为从 $-0.25$ 到 $1.25$,间隔 $0.001$ 的等距序列:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "efae2099",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "pred=Predict.Kriging(a.gp,data.frame(x=test))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e0862133",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "由于不能直接创建绘制多边形的画布,因此先创建一个空白画布,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 折线类型为空;\n",
    "- $x$ 轴范围为 $[-0.25,1.25]$,$y$ 轴范围为 $[\\min(y)-0.5,1.5]$;\n",
    "- 图形主标题为"Gaussian process regression";\n",
    "- 主标题缩放倍数为 2:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6d5030c2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "plot(test,truey,type=\"n\",xlim=c(l,u),ylim=c(min(y)-.5,1.5),main=\"Gaussian process regression\",cex.main=2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2d1b443c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "令 95% 预测区间(依据 $3\\sigma$ 原则手动计算)的上下界分别为 `up` 与 `low`.叠加置信区间多边形,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 多边形边界为 $[-0.25,1.25]\\times[\\text{low},\\text{up}]$;\n",
    "- 多边形颜色为粉色;\n",
    "- 边界颜色为粉色:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "95035c1a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "low=pred$mean-2*pred$sd\n",
    "up=pred$mean+2*pred$sd\n",
    "polygon(c(test,rev(test)),c(low,rev(up)),col=\"pink\",border=\"pink\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c369a276",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "叠加拟合值 $\\widehat{y}$,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 线的颜色为绿色;\n",
    "- 线的宽度为 3;\n",
    "- 线的类型为虚线:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a962ded5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "lines(test,pred$mean,col=3,lwd=3,lty=2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4b74af78",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "叠加真实值 $f(\\boldsymbol{x})$,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 线的宽度为 3:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7e4c060f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "lines(test,truey,lwd=3)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "86946a4c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "叠加散点,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 点的形状为实心圆;\n",
    "- 点的缩放倍数为 2;\n",
    "- 点的颜色为蓝色:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1594ae09",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "points(x,y,pch=16,cex=2,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3a8733d8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "叠加图例,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 位置位于左上角;\n",
    "- 图例名为 `truth` 与 `prediction`;\n",
    "- 线型,颜色,线宽与二者分别对应;\n",
    "- 不画图例边框:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ae25e9f8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "legend(\"topleft\", legend = c(\"truth\",\"prediction\"),lty=c(1,2),col=c(1,3),lwd=c(3,3),bty = \"n\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "34e1b419",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "将画布还原回 1x1:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c99e495e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "par(mfrow=c(1,1))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a09472ed",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "449a3730",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 最终效果"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "8ceb7963",
   "metadata": {
    "vscode": {
     "languageId": "r"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "Plot with title \"Gaussian process regression\""
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {
      "image/png": {
       "height": 300,
       "width": 600
      }
     },
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# 图 1.5\n",
    "\n",
    "options(repr.plot.width=10, repr.plot.height=5)\n",
    "par(mfrow=c(1,2))\n",
    "n=6\n",
    "x=rep(c(0,1),c(n/2,n/2))\n",
    "f=function(x) sin(10*pi*x)/(1+64*(x-.25)^2)+x^2\n",
    "set.seed(7)\n",
    "y=f(x)+.1*rnorm(n)\n",
    "l=-.25\n",
    "u=1.25\n",
    "test=seq(l,u,.001)\n",
    "truey=f(test)\n",
    "\n",
    "## 线性拟合\n",
    "\n",
    "a.lm=lm(y~x)\n",
    "pred=predict.lm(a.lm,newdata=data.frame(x=test),interval=\"prediction\")\n",
    "plot(test,truey,type=\"n\",xlim=c(l,u),ylim=c(min(y)-.5,1.5),main=\"Linear regression\",cex.main=2)\n",
    "low=pred[,2]\n",
    "up=pred[,3]\n",
    "polygon(c(test,rev(test)),c(low,rev(up)),col=\"pink\",border=\"pink\")\n",
    "lines(test,pred[,1],col=3,lwd=3,lty=2)\n",
    "lines(test,truey,lwd=3)\n",
    "points(x,y,pch=16,cex=2,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "legend(\"topleft\", legend = c(\"truth\",\"prediction\"),lty=c(1,2),col=c(1,3),lwd=c(3,3),bty = \"n\")\n",
    "\n",
    "## GP\n",
    "\n",
    "library(rkriging)\n",
    "a.gp=Fit.Kriging(x,y,interpolation=FALSE,fit=TRUE,model=\"OK\",kernel.parameters=list(type=\"Gaussian\"))\n",
    "pred=Predict.Kriging(a.gp,data.frame(x=test))\n",
    "plot(test,truey,type=\"n\",xlim=c(l,u),ylim=c(min(y)-.5,1.5),main=\"Gaussian process regression\",cex.main=2)\n",
    "low=pred$mean-2*pred$sd\n",
    "up=pred$mean+2*pred$sd\n",
    "polygon(c(test,rev(test)),c(low,rev(up)),col=\"pink\",border=\"pink\")\n",
    "lines(test,pred$mean,col=3,lwd=3,lty=2)\n",
    "lines(test,truey,lwd=3)\n",
    "points(x,y,pch=16,col=\"blue\",cex=2)\n",
    "legend(\"topleft\", legend = c(\"truth\",\"prediction\"),lty=c(1,2),col=c(1,3),lwd=c(3,3),bty = \"n\")\n",
    "\n",
    "par(mfrow=c(1,1))"
   ]
  },
  {
